<title>USA: Iomega to move portions of manufacturing.</title>
<headline>Iomega to move portions of manufacturing.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega Corp said it intends to move a substantial portion of its Zip, Jaz and Ditto manufacturing to its new manufacturing facility in Penang, Malaysia after a re-evaluation of its contract manufacturing.</p>
<p>As a result, Iomega said that it recently took over control from Seiko Epson of the subcontractor producing Zip drives in the Philippines and it is negotiating the transfer of its Jaz drive production from Sequel.</p>
</text>
